ters/MTF3.jpg" alt="MTF3.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p style="text-align: center;"></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">给Site-CN-10的MTF“末日星云”设计的logo</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">涂抹真的超好玩我玩了一下午（</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p style="text-align: center;">第一版因为灰度的原因被毙了 第二版就长的粗暴了一些w</p> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/mountains/MTF5.jpg" alt="MTF5.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/old-mother-hunters/MTF4'.png" alt="MTF4'.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p style="text-align: center;"></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">给Site-CN-10深空部设计的logo</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">妈呀可怕</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p style="text-align: center;">按照liangyue老师的要求设计滴！</p> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/auroriaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa/%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E9%83%A8.png" alt="深空部.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p style="text-align: center;"></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">给Site-CN-10模因部设计的logo</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">眼睛眼睛眼睛</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p style="text-align: center;">陈洛是憨批！</p> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/mountains/%E6%A8%A1%E5%9B%A0%E9%83%A8.png" alt="模因