=1606050443" alt="aetherium" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5657018)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aetherium" >aetherium</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">饼子做我女朋友！——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6455279&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606050443" alt="Raidwine" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6455279)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine" >Raidwine</a></span></span> <span style="color: red"><em>已否决</em></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>《阿拉伯机械帝国史》，历史控深深得满足ing——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606050443" alt="Confucian Lee" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6591621)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" >Confucian Lee</a></span></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <blockquote> <p>所有平台上的消息我应该都会在七天内回复，如果有超过14天和三个平台都没有回话的话（除去某些我事先说过的特殊原因）那应该是人死了，麻烦互相通知一下，之后就不要来找我了，毕竟那时候我也没办法跟你们说了。勿念（<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">啊喂也没人会念吧（</span>。</p> </blockquote> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5474061&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606050443" alt="Auroriaaaaa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5474061)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" >Auroriaaaaa</a></span></p> 
