&lt;p&gt;……（&lt;span class=&quot;error-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;TheCassowary&lt;/em&gt; 不匹配任何一个现有的用户名&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/not-a-seagull/rsr_calvin_4.png&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;rsr_calvin_4.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我发誓，我只穿过*一次*露臀装。（&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5950867&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606050449&quot; alt=&quot;KaraKatt&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5950867)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt&quot;  &gt;KaraKatt&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;
